 ## 工具
 
+本地开发版增加 `pet_presentation_state` 和 `pet_say.presentation`（schema 1）：原生头顶气泡支持文字、Unicode 表情与静态 PNG 混排，或只显示一张图。提交 requestId、bodyCue 和 segments；宿主自动绑定实际形象，在执行时重新检查身体状态，等待动作回报和目标 face 生效后展示。旧 figure、expectedStateRevision 仅为兼容字段，不再作为拒绝回复的前提。未知状态、打断或身体状态冲突时取消。旧 `script` 和 `images` 语义保留，不能与 presentation 同时提供正文。图片附件句柄通过宿主读取，最多四张、单张 2 MiB、合计 4 MiB，单张尺寸最多 2048×2048。`presentation` 的成功回执表示气泡已开始展示，后续仍可能被打断。
+
+The local development build adds `pet_presentation_state` and `pet_say.presentation` schema 1 for mixed text, emoji and static PNG head bubbles, including image-only bubbles. Submit a unique requestId, bodyCue and segments. The host binds the actual figure and validates live state at execution; legacy figure and revision hints do not reject a reply. Display waits for a subsequent body frame confirming the action and target face; unknown or conflicting states cancel it. Legacy script and images remain supported separately. A successful receipt confirms display started, not that it cannot subsequently be interrupted. Speech uses text only; emoji nodes and image metadata are excluded. Third-party TTS consumers must adopt this projection in their own release.
+
 | 工具 | 作用 | 回执 |
 |---|---|---|
 | `pet_say(script, images?)` | 冒气泡说话;`【词】` 先做动作再换新气泡,`<词>` 打字到那里时做。`images` 是附件句柄,图片只显示在对话页;只有图片时不要求桌宠窗口在线 | 立即返回,报约显示多久、前面排了多久 |
