 和画大肥鱼用的 rig),`web/coo/` 是 Coo 的造型、配件与形象包入口,`web/sound.js` 是合成音效与包自带音频的播放,
 `web/body-host.js` 是桌宠页、装扮页这一侧的身体代理。
+
+Expression hints follow current Habits without scheduling replies; custom checked touches are lively only when already triggering an immediate reply. Typed/voice requests use natural style under custom. pet state exposes presentationCapabilities and expression (preference/recent outcomes); diagnostics contain no message bodies and are bounded to 50 entries. {{pet.expressions}} supplies model guidance; fresh event hints supersede older summaries. This is the first-stage direct-presentation integration, not an emotion-to-private-library shortcut.
+
+头顶结构化气泡中的🫂使用内置原创SVG，兼容缺少该字形的系统字体；文字与语音投影保持原样，无需下载字体。
+Structured bubbles render 🫂 with bundled original SVG artwork when system fonts lack that glyph. Text semantics and speech projection stay unchanged; no font download is required.
